// .cursor\rules\backend.mdc
---
description: Backend architecture, server patterns, actions, services and repositories
globs:
  - "src/features/**/server/**/*"
  - "src/server/**/*"
  - "src/app/api/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---
# Backend Architecture

- Server Actions for mutations
- Route Handlers for webhooks/public APIs
- Keep business logic out of route handlers
- Use service layer for workflows
- Use repository layer for Prisma access
- Trigger.dev for async jobs

- business logic

repository.ts:
- Prisma queries only

# Antipatterns - Do Not:
- put Prisma inside components
- put business logic inside UI
- create giant files
- inline AI prompts
- duplicate validation schemas

